{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13478","headline":"春思赠人 · 柳中庸","name":"春思赠人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"红粉当三五，青娥艳一双。\n绮罗回锦陌，弦管入花江。\n落雁惊金弹，抛杯泻玉缸。\n谁知褐衣客，顦顇在书窗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳中庸","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13478.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13478","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}